From: MYIR Tech <support@myirtech.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 12:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm: avoid null clone encoder and plane dereferences

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [i.MX8MP product-specific clone extension]
Signed-off-by: MYIR Tech <support@myirtech.com>
---
 libweston/backend-drm/drm.c | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libweston/backend-drm/drm.c b/libweston/backend-drm/drm.c
--- a/libweston/backend-drm/drm.c
+++ b/libweston/backend-drm/drm.c
@@ -3307,0 +3308,8 @@
+				if (!encoder || !plane_res) {
+					weston_log("DRM: clone connector %d has no encoder/plane resources.\n",
+						   connector_id);
+					drmModeFreeEncoder(encoder);
+					drmModeFreeConnector(conn);
+					continue;
+				}
+
@@ -3310,0 +3319,2 @@
+					if (!plane)
+						continue;
